## Plain-English Summary (non-binding)

Vehicle Maintenance Tracker (VMT) is "source-available" software. In short:

- ✅ **Use it freely** — including running it in or as part of your business
- ✅ **Modify it** — fork it, extend it, customize it
- ✅ **Redistribute it** — share it, host it, deploy it for clients (free of charge)
- ✅ **Build on it** — embed it in products you sell, *provided VMT itself is not the thing being sold*
- ❌ **Do not sell the software itself** — you may not charge money for VMT or any derivative of this source code, where its value is substantially derived from VMT
- 📋 **Attribution required** — keep this license and copyright notice intact in all copies and derivatives (per Apache-2.0 terms)

